{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-03-29 13:10:00', 'title': 'TOLEDO EDISON TEAMS WITH METROPARKS TOLEDO TO PROTECT NESTING BIRDS', 'text': 'TOLEDO, OHIO , MARCH 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS PART OF ITS ONGOING EFFORTS TO PROTECT NESTING BIRDS, TOLEDO EDISON, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), HAS TEAMED WITH METROPARKS TOLEDO TO DONATE AND INSTALL A 55-FOOT WOODEN POLE WITH A NESTING PLATFORM AT THE MANHATTAN MARSH PRESERVE METROPARK IN NORTH TOLEDO. THIS PROACTIVE WORK WILL PROVIDE A SAFE NESTING LOCATION FOR THE GROWING OSPREY POPULATION AND PROMOTE OSPREY CONSERVATION EFFORTS IN THE AREA.'}